  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-drains\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Water Line Services Provided by Licensed Plumbers in Durham</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Happy Home Services specializes in water line installation, repair, and replacement for homes across Durham, Raleigh, Chapel Hill, Cary, and Morrisville, addressing issues like leaks, low water pressure, and line corrosion. We utilize advanced techniques and quality materials to guarantee durable solutions tailored to your specific needs. With our commitment to customer satisfaction and prompt service, you can trust us to minimize disruptions and restore your water supply efficiently.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/images/2024/11/water-line-image.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/water-line-image.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/11/water-line-image-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/11/water-line-image-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/11/water-line-image-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Water Line Inspection & Repair </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-pressure-assessments\">Low water pressure</a>, a soggy patch in your yard, or an unexplained spike in your water bill often points to a problem with your main water line. Our licensed plumbers use diagnostic tools to locate the actual issue before recommending a fix, and favor low-impact repair methods over fully trenching your yard whenever your line is a good candidate for it.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Water Line Installations </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>From minor water pipe repairs to full underground water line replacement, we handle it all. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with a broken line or planning a new installation, we&#8217;ll make sure the work is done safely, reliably, and up to code.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-tools\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Signs You Need Water Line Repair </h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Call us for emergency water line repair if you notice:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Low water pressure throughout your home</li>\n<li>Wet patches or pooling water in your yard</li>\n<li>An unexplained increase in your water bill</li>\n<li>The sound of running water when no taps are open</li>\n<li>A cracked or visibly broken water line</li>\n<li>Discolored or rusty water</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Photo of a drain from a bathroom sink in a customers home in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/Photo-of-a-drain-from-a-bathroom-sink.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Drain Cleaning and Tackling Tough Clogs in Durham and all Surrounding Areas </p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">Our technicians handle everything from a simple sink clog to a full sewer line repair, using the right tool for the job — whether that's a drain auger, hydro jetting, or camera inspection. Whether you need routine drain maintenance or emergency service, we're equipped to get your plumbing flowing again quickly. Contact us today to schedule service anywhere in Durham, Raleigh, Chapel Hill, Cary, or Morrisville. </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 14;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:14;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png