00w, /images/2024/02/Daikin-logo-768x162.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Daikin-logo.png 1018w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/york-install-confidence-vector-logo-300x167.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"York logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/york-install-confidence-vector-logo-300x167.png 300w, /images/2024/02/york-install-confidence-vector-logo-768x427.png 768w, /images/2024/02/york-install-confidence-vector-logo.png 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"53\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Honeywell-logo-300x53.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Honeywell logo an HVAC partner in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Honeywell-logo-300x53.png 300w, /images/2024/02/Honeywell-logo-1024x181.png 1024w, /images/2024/02/Honeywell-logo-768x136.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Honeywell-logo.png 1413w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" src=\"/images/2024/02/rheem.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Rheem logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/rheem.png 225w, /images/2024/02/rheem-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"88\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-300x88.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Mitsubishi Electric logo an HVAC partner in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-300x88.png 300w, /images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-768x226.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo.png 851w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"57\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-300x57.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Water Furnace logo an HVAC partner in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-300x57.png 300w, /images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-768x147.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n        </ul>\n</div>\n\n            <h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">\n                And Dozens More\n            </h6></div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--center py-3 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color wp-elements-5\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-3\">Qualified for All Major Makes and Models</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"wp-block-group flow mb-2 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n    <p>Our team of expert technicians is trained to handle all makes and models of major brands with precision and care. From routine maintenance to complex repairs, we ensure top-notch service for all.</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Ensure optimal efficiency of all your systems</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Lower your utility costs with energy efficiency</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications & Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 2;\" data-logo-count=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:2;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"249\" height=\"245\" src=\"/images/2024/03/OnCallAir-Customer-First-Award-Winner.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"OnCallAir Customer First Award Winner\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE) given to Happy Home in Durham, NC\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png 252w, /images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE-150x150.png 150w\" /></div>                    </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div id=\"FAQs\" class=\"wp-block-group py-5 flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FAQs</h2>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How much does it cost to repair or replace a water line? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Cost depends on a few factors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Location of the issue — a repair inside the home typically costs less than an underground main line repair</li>\n<li>Extent of the damage — a minor pipe repair costs less than a full line replacement</li>\n<li>Access — if your line runs under landscaping, a driveway, or a sidewalk, excavation and restoration add to the cost</li>\n<li>Pipe length and depth — longer or deeper replacements need more labor and equipment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>After an in-person consultation and inspection, we&#8217;ll give you a detailed quote with no surprises.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Should I repair my water line or replace it? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>A targeted repair can resolve minor leaks or damage just fine. But if your main line is corroded, sagging, or leaking repeatedly, full replacement is often the better long-term solution. We&#8217;ll inspect the line and walk you through your options clearly rather than pushing one option by default.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How long does a water line replacement take? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Many replacements are completed in a few days, though the exact timing depends on pipe length, depth, and how accessible the line is. We&#8217;ll give you a clear timeline during your consultation.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Will you need to dig up my whole yard to repair my water line? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Not necessarily — our goal is to minimize disruption to your property. In many cases, targeted excavation lets us repair or replace a section of your line without fully trenching the yard. For some replacements, we may use directional boring or other low-impact techniques where the situation allows.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">When should I schedule a water line inspection? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>It&#8217;s worth scheduling one if you notice a sudden drop in water pressure, unexplained pooling in your yard, a spike in your water bill, discolored water, or if you simply suspect aging pipes or a slow leak.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Clamp meter on HVAC unit\" class=\"wp-image-5359\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Happy Home Service VIP Club</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive with Our VIP Maintenance Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>Up to 25% Discount on Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Up to an additional 25% discount on parts and labor</li>\n\n<li>Same Day Service</li>\n\n<li>Triple Labor Warranty</li>\n\n<li>50% off Minimum Service Fee</li>\n\n<li>$50 Yearly Rebate</li>\n\n<li>Flexible Payment Options</li>\n\n<li>Convenient Service Reminders</li>\n\n<li>Your 13th Month Free when you join or renew your one-year plan</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services employee speaking on the phone with a customer\" class=\"wp-image-4758\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">We Offer Financing!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services proudly offers financing options through Goodleap<sup>®</sup> and GreenSky<sup>®</sup>. Financing options let you tackle necessary repairs or upgrades without draining your savings or delaying important projects. <br></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Financing is dependent on service requirements and credit history. Some of our short- and long-term financing options include:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>0% interest</li>\n\n<li>6.99% interest</li>\n\n<li>$58/month for furnaces</li>\n\n<li>$99/month for AC/heating units</li>\n\n<li>And more!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/financing\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>        <div id=\"reviews\" class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\