 class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text\">\n                Reviews <span class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating\"><div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Nicole Tinnen\" aria-label=\"Nicole Tinnen\">Nicole Tinnen</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>The customer service from the phone call to the gentleman coming into my house was perfect 🤩! I was able to get an appointment the same day I called. My issue was resolved Monday. I had no heat and they was nice to let me borrow a heater. Thank you guys so much.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Damon Nance\" aria-label=\"Damon Nance\">Damon Nance</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>My technician was on time, polite, knowledgeable, and a real pleasure to deal with. He was proficient and efficient. He took his time, explained everything and gave me a great overview. I would recommend Happy Home to anyone.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Billy Strickland\" aria-label=\"Billy Strickland\">Billy Strickland</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>The service technician came to do the fall/winter maintenance on my heat/AC unit. He was very thorough. Did a great job servicing, and cleaning the unit, and the air cleaner unit. Very courteous and friendly. Definitely a professional technician.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"our-community\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"69\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png\" class=\"custom-logo\" alt=\"Happy Home Services, a NearU Company, logo, an HVAC, Plumbing, and Indoor Air Quality services company in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png 800w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-300x104.png 300w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-768x265.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" /></a></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Serving the Greater Durham &amp; Chapel Hill Communities for 70 Years!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services has been the trusted HVAC and plumbing company in <strong>Greater Durham</strong> and <strong>Chapel Hill, NC, </strong>since 1955. Our team of technicians is background-checked